  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-q">Inprimis ut conueniant semper ad quatuor ebdomadas, et faciat omnis homo rectum alii.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-b">Ærest þæt hi heo gegaderian á ymb feower wucan, ⁊ wyrce ælc man oðrum riht.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-cons-cn">Primum quidem quod semper circa IIII septimanas congregentur, et quisque alii rectum faciat.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="1" corresp="#wit-b">Ærest, þæt hi heo gegaderian á ymb feower wucan, ⁊ wyrce ælc man oðrum riht.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">In the first place, they shall assemble without fail every four weeks, and every man shall do justice to his fellow.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-b">First, that they are to assemble every four weeks and each man is to do justice to another.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Erstens, dass sie [die Eingesessenen des Hundred] sich nach je vier Wochen versammeln, und jedermann dem andern [processuale] Pflicht erfülle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">First, that they [the inhabitants of the hundred] assemble every four weeks, and that everyone do [legal] right to the other.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="193"><ref target="clause:IIEw_8">II Ew 8</ref>; <ref target="clause:IEw_Prol">I Ew Pr.</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Vgl. II Ew. 8; I Pr.</note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:IIIEg_5">III Eg 5</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-ppmel" n="196"><ref target="clause:IIEw_8">II Ew 8</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="316"><ref target="clause:IIIEg_1-1">III Eg 1.1–4</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="316"><ref target="clause:IIIEg_5">III Eg 5–5.2</ref></note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares II Ew 8; I [Atr] Pr.</note>
      </div>
